<section class="brands-manifesto">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="brands-narrow">
      <p>Pune Bookies is a reading community in Pune. We meet every Sunday under a tree. About 250 of us, give or take, for two hours, in silence. It's been happening every Sunday since early 2024.</p>
      <p>We're not a publication. We're not an event series. We're not building toward a platform. The Sunday is the thing — not a funnel to anything else. We don't charge for it, we don't take emails at the door, and we don't put anyone's branding on the tree.</p>
      <p>And still: we like working with brands. Some of our favourite Sundays had a partner on the grass. The ones that work are the ones where the brand brings something that belongs there — a thing readers are quietly glad to find next to them. Not signage. Not a campaign. Something a reader would keep.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
